---
title: "OpenClaw — Bojoo Online"
layout: null
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% include "header.njk" %}

<style>
  .opencloud-page {
    padding: 40px 0 60px;
  }
  .oc-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .oc-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .oc-hero p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .status-bar {
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .status-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .status-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .status-dot.green { background: #4caf50; }
  .status-dot.yellow { background: #ff9800; }
  .status-dot.gray { background: #999; }
  .oc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .oc-card {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .oc-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .oc-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .oc-card .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .tag-ready { background: #e6f4ea; color: #1b7a3d; }
  .tag-wip { background: #fff3e0; color: #e65100; }
  .tag-plan { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1565c0; }
  .timeline {
    background: var(--color-bg-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .timeline h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .timeline-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .timeline-date {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    min-width: 80px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .timeline-content {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>

<section class="opencloud-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="oc-hero">
      <h1>☁️ OpenClaw</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">宝珠落地</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Status Bar -->
    <div class="status-bar">
      <div class="status-item">
        <span class="status-dot green"></span>
        <span>服务器集群</span>
      </div>
      <div class="status-item">
        <span class="status-dot green"></span>
        <span>数据库服务</span>
      </div>
      <div class="status-item">
        <span class="status-dot green"></span>
        <span>Agent 运行</span>
      </div>
      <div class="status-item">
        <span class="status-dot yellow"></span>
        <span>CI/CD 管道</span>
      </div>
      <div class="status-item">
        <span class="status-dot gray"></span>
        <span>多租户隔离</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature Cards -->
    <div class="oc-grid">
      <div class="oc-card">
        <h3>🤖 Agent 运行环境 <span class="tag tag-ready">已就绪</span></h3>
        <p>
          支持多 Agent 并行运行，当前已部署成本管控、差评收集两个 Agent，
          小红书运营 Agent 开发中。每个 Agent 独立虚拟环境，互不干扰。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="oc-card">
        <h3>🗄️ 数据服务 <span class="tag tag-ready">已就绪</span></h3>
        <p>
          SQLite 数据库集群，三层数据架构（L1原始 → L2筛选 → L3清洗）。
          支持多平台数据源（大众点评/美团/饿了么/小红书）统一接入。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="oc-card">
        <h3>📡 消息推送 <span class="tag tag-ready">已就绪</span></h3>
        <p>
          企微 Webhook 推送系统，支持文字消息、Excel 文件、图片等多种格式。
          差评预警、周报推送、日报简报均通过企微群实时送达。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="oc-card">
        <h3>🌐 网站托管 <span class="tag tag-wip">推进中</span></h3>
        <p>
          bojoo.cn（官网）+ bojoo.online（内部工具站）双域策略。
          当前 Vercel MVP 部署中，计划迁移至百度智能云。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="oc-card">
        <h3>🔒 安全与权限 <span class="tag tag-wip">推进中</span></h3>
        <p>
          Cookie 自动刷新与监控，API Key 分级管理，
          服务每日自动重启防假死，CDP 浏览器反风控策略。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="oc-card">
        <h3>📊 BI 与报表 <span class="tag tag-plan">规划中</span></h3>
        <p>
          财务 BI 看板（演示版已上线）、自动化周报/日报生成、
          多维度数据交叉分析，AI 经营洞察。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <div class="timeline">
      <h3>📅 推进时间线</h3>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-date">2026-05-07</span>
        <span class="timeline-content">✅ 差评系统全量采集上线（三平台 1556 条）</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-date">2026-05-13</span>
        <span class="timeline-content">✅ 意图分流 v2 + 企微群聊机器人上线</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-date">2026-05-22</span>
        <span class="timeline-content">✅ 成本管控 Agent 部署完成</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-date">2026-05-25</span>
        <span class="timeline-content">✅ 小红书 CDP 搜索采集跑通 + L1~L4 数据库架构</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-date">2026-05-28</span>
        <span class="timeline-content">✅ Plan 1 企业门户规划完成（bojoo.cn + bojoo.online）</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-date">2026-05-31</span>
        <span class="timeline-content">🔄 财务 BI 演示版上线 + OpenClaw 推进页面发布</span>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-date">Next</span>
        <span class="timeline-content">⏳ 小红书运营文档 + 珠光计划模块 + BI 数据对接</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
